3][S16T4].\n- On 2023-10-19, told Dave he has started touring with Frank Ocean (\"lots happened\" since they last talked) — \"it's been amazing\": so much energy from the crowd and \"such a connection when I'm on stage — unreal!\"; the tour \"has been great\" and \"jamming with Frank Ocean is a dream come true\" (another Frank Ocean tour after the earlier ones listed here — Dave is looking forward to attending one of its shows, see the 2023-10-19 entry in ## Relationships) [S24T1][S24T3].\n- On 2023-10-19, shared another photo of the tour crowd: a crowd of people at a concert with their hands in the air — \"Wow, the crowd energy is amazing! It always gets me so pumped and it's awesome. Look at that photo, that was awesome!\"; when Dave asked where it was taken, Calvin said it was taken in Tokyo during a concert — \"the energy was nuts - felt like the whole city came out!\" (Dave's enthusiasm about visiting Tokyo, see /memories/dave.md > ## Japan) [S24T9][S24T10][S24T11].\n- On 2023-10-19, announced he's actually going to Tokyo in November 2023 (\"next month\") after the tour ends — shared a photo of a city at night with a tall building in the background (\"What a great view!\") and said \"Sometimes I wish I could go back to places like [that]\"; spots he's excited to check out: Shibuya Crossing — \"like Tokyo's Times Square\" — and Shinjuku; he can't wait to try the amazing food there again (shared a photo of Shibuya Crossing at night — a crowd of people with umbrellas in the rain); he has never tried ramen but \"it's supposed to be awesome\" — \"Gonna give it a shot while in Tokyo!\" — after Dave (who tried ramen in Boston) encouraged him (Dave's side in /memories/dave.md > ## Japan) [S24T17][S24T19][S24T21].","text_sha256":"a629b9d2074199dbf9e76a83197d62fa7bfd4ee63f3b9cb4ffde048994af219e","timestamp":null}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497